INSERT INTO `testimonials` VALUES (1,'Prof. Tessie Gulgowski','Student',NULL,4,'However, she got back to the fifth bend, I think?\' \'I had NOT!\' cried the Gryphon. \'Turn a somersault in the book,\' said.',1,1,'2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50'),(2,'Lavinia Toy','Courier',NULL,5,'March Hare. \'Then it doesn\'t matter a bit,\' said the Hatter, \'I cut some more of the words a little, and then another confusion of voices--\'Hold up his head--Brandy now--Don\'t choke him--How.',1,1,'2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50'),(3,'Myles Lebsack','Sender',NULL,5,'It\'s by far the most curious thing I ever heard!\' \'Yes, I think you\'d better ask HER about it.\' (The jury all wrote down on one of them were animals, and some were birds,) \'I suppose so,\' said Alice.',1,1,'2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50'),(4,'Luisa Kuphal','Sender',NULL,4,'YET,\' she said to the Dormouse, and repeated her question. \'Why did you ever saw. How she longed to get out at all comfortable, and it set to.',1,1,'2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50'),(5,'Rosetta Bechtelar','Sender',NULL,5,'And she kept on puzzling about it in a fight with another dig of her head to hide a smile: some of them bowed low. \'Would you tell me,\' said Alice, who felt very lonely and.',1,1,'2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50'),(6,'Koby Blick','Student',NULL,5,'Mind now!\' The poor little thing sat down and cried. \'Come, there\'s half my plan done now! How puzzling all these strange Adventures of hers that you never to lose YOUR temper!\'.',1,1,'2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50'),(7,'Kiana Turner PhD','Frequent traveler',NULL,4,'Alice panted as she swam nearer to make SOME change in my own tears! That WILL be a lesson to you to offer it,\' said the Queen, who had been looking at everything about.',0,1,'2026-05-20 05:05:50','2026-05-20 05:05:50','2